				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>At Coastal Friends Mangalore (R), friendship is not just a word—it’s the foundation of everything we do. We believe that genuine connections formed through face-to-face interactions are essential to building a stronger, more connected society. To be a part of our organization, one must not only know each other but have met in person, ensuring that all relationships are founded on trust, sincerity, and mutual respect.</p><p>Our motto, &#8220;Friendship for a Cause&#8221;, reflects our belief that when we come together as friends, we can achieve much more than just personal connections. We harness the power of our friendships to make meaningful, lasting changes in the world around us. Whether it’s supporting local communities, organizing charitable events, or engaging in uplifting initiatives, we strive to act as a united force for good.</p>								</div>
